          "message": {
            "text": "These rows target omission, not arbitrary parameter motion. The two Open Sans baselines start at truthful non-default wght and wdth locations before dropping all axes to defaults, while the HarfBuzz upstream golden starts at ptem 9 before unsetting ptem. That makes a missing setVariations or setPtem call causal; a clamped coordinate perturbation cannot create a false pass. Every row is in-memory and pre-raster.",
            "markdown": "These rows target omission, not arbitrary parameter motion. The two Open Sans baselines start at truthful non-default wght and wdth locations before dropping all axes to defaults, while the HarfBuzz upstream golden starts at ptem 9 before unsetting ptem. That makes a missing setVariations or setPtem call causal; a clamped coordinate perturbation cannot create a false pass. Every row is in-memory and pre-raster."
          },
